    "summary": "Normal daemon host now supplies durable publication/preflight to both reviewer routes. Atomic report+pending state suppresses completion until journalled full history, compact reference and receipt are durable. Retry_publication is explicit/idempotent and model-free; fault and capacity tests cover append/head/receipt failure, raised history allowance, known-minimum refusal/resume, immutable baselines and exact owned metadata delta. Legacy source revision zero is represented honestly. All 106 relevant tests and TypeScript pass.",
